<title>USA: Brandywine declares supplemental dividend.</title>
<headline>Brandywine declares supplemental dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brandywine Realty Trust on Monday declared a supplemental fourth quarter dividend of $0.12 cents per share payable on January 16, 1997 to shareholders of record on December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Adding this dividend to the company's previously announced 1996 fourth quarter dividend of $0.13 cents per share increases the company's 1996 fourth quarter dividend to a total of $0.25 cents per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
